// ===== PORT BOUNDARY: mirrors firmware/ui.cpp — same functions, same order; edit config.h, not this file, to change timings =====
//
// Plain script, no modules, no libraries. Two halves:
//   1. a tiny Adafruit_GFX shim (below) that draws into a 240x240 ImageData
//      with the SAME pixel semantics as the real library, classic 5x7 font
//      included, so what the browser shows is what the panel would show;
//   2. the line-for-line port of firmware/ui.cpp, starting at "ui_fmt0".
// Every tunable and every colour comes from the global FW, generated by the
// build script from firmware/config.h. Nothing is hard-coded here that exists
// there.
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// PART 1 — Adafruit_GFX shim
// Pixel-exact port of Adafruit_GFX (classic 5x7 font path only) onto a
// CanvasRenderingContext2D, for a fixed 240x240 backing buffer.
// Ported from Adafruit-GFX-Library 1.12.6 (Adafruit_GFX.cpp / .h, glcdfont.c);
// the glyph table below is a machine copy of glcdfont.c at that tag, 1280 bytes.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

